 answers and at most 512 KiB each; each request counts as one submission. For timed modes, start reconnects to the same attempt; only retry spends one of the unique_attempts_remaining. After all fresh variants are used, practice continues on the last artifact without a timer or Hall of Fame time and can still complete the mode. Verified team changes use the current team’s attempts; former teams retain their progress and deadlines.\", 'download': '/?op=download&capability=8b29a76112f74e97b493445671891c14dc3bb98f2fea4f6fb2c99d8439c59e8e', 'sha256': '08092cc83956b363d385540b735de4538e9e0d230cade07e8a53f9e4598d7ba2', 'answer_ids': 'list913', 'deadline': None}\n913\n[('attack', 104), ('role', 101), ('campaign', 100), ('adapter', 89), ('profile', 68), ('count', 60), ('steps', 60), ('url', 49), ('obfuscation', 48), ('language', 34), ('style', 27), ('path', 22), ('control', 18), ('syntax', 14), ('carrier', 14), ('chain', 14), ('feature', 12), ('primitive', 12), ('stage', 9), ('expansion', 9), ('graph', 9), ('representation', 9), ('transform', 9), ('id', 6), ('extension', 4), ('scenario', 3), ('note', 2), ('name', 2), ('wallet', 1), ('mutex', 1), ('file', 1), ('agent', 1), ('host', 1)]\n[('evidence.zip', 913)]\nanswer_ids [\"resource-scenario\", \"resource-attack\", \"resource-url\", \"resource-wallet\", \"resource-mutex\", \"collection-scenario\", \"collection-attack\", \"collection-url\", \"collection-file\", \"collection-user-agent\", \"impact-scenario\", \"impact-attack\", \"impact-extension\", \"impact-note\", \"impact-url\", \"jscript-benign-role\", \"jscript-benign-attack\", \"jscript-benign-adapter\", \"jscript-benign-campaign\", \"jscript-benign-host\", \"jscript-stager-role\", \"jscript-stager-attack\", \"jscript-stager-adapter\", \"jscript-stager-campaign\", \"jscript-stager-url\", \"jscript-dropper-role\", \"jscript-dropper-attack\", \"jscript-dropper-adapter\", \"jscript-dropper-campaign\", \"jscript-dropper-path\", \"jscript-downloader-role\", \"jscript-downloa